  "title": "Pasta in Vodka Sauce",
  "description": "A generous measure of vodka and prosciutto is cooked down to its savory essence to flavor a saute of onion, celery and garlic. Simmer with tomatoes, spicy cayenne, oregano, parsley and basil, then stir in half and half. A marvelous sauce over noodles!",
  "authors": [
    "Joelene Craver"
  ],
